 "scope": "Hollow VOL polygons whose wall offset changes topology. dumbbell_neck: narrow waist closes under the wall while lobe edges survive -> algebraic tube formula. dumbbell_saturated: tube formula overshoots the footprint -> clamped to full area. notch_consumed: every offset edge is consumed while the tube formula still yields 0.90 of the footprint -> fully plated at the footprint area. dumbbell_negative: tube formula goes negative with no surviving edge -> fully plated at the footprint area. Verified 18.53: the cross-section is the algebraic t*(P-t*sum(cot)) while any offset edge survives, else the footprint area.",
 "resource_geometry_sources": {
  "dumbbell_neck": "data/c1_dumbbell/series",
